<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Test - Le Trésor Public</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', cursive; text-align: center; margin: 0; padding: 0; 
            background: #090a0f; color: #ffffff; overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        .soleil-cadre { 
            width: 140px; height: 140px; background: #FFD700; border-radius: 50%; 
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; 
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px #FFA500; margin: 20px auto; text-decoration: none; color: #333;
        }
        .bulles-grid { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 20px; }
        .nuage { background: #e0f7fa; border: 3px solid #008080; border-radius: 50px; padding: 20px; width: 300px; color: #000080; text-decoration: none; }
        .moteur-fraternel { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border: 2px solid #f0e68c; padding: 20px; border-radius: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto; }
        input { margin: 10px; border-radius: 5px; border: none; padding: 5px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1 style="color: #f0e68c;">La Fraternité du Palais Nature</h1>

    <div class="soleil-cadre">
        <strong>LES DONS ENTIERS</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="bulles-grid">
        <div class="nuage">
            <h3>📜 L'Œuvre Commune</h3>
            <p>Nettoyage, routes, logistique. La fierté de servir.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="nuage" style="background: #fff9c4;">
            <h3>⭐ La Main Tendue</h3>
            <p>Santé, aide, écoute et câlins de l'âme.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="moteur-fraternel">
        <h3>🔍 Rayonnement Fraternel</h3>
        <input type="text" placeholder="Ville / Pays"><br>
        <input type="range" min="1" max="500"> <br>
        <button style="background: #008080; color: white; border: none; padding: 10px; border-radius: 10px;">Lancer le Don</button>
    </div>

    <p style="font-style: italic; color: #f0e68c;">"Tu prépares le pain, je prépare la chanson."</p>

</body>
</html>
